{"data": {"Page": {"pageInfo": {"currentPage": 17, "hasNextPage": true}, "media": [{"id": 143315, "title": {"romaji": "Climbing", "english": "Climbing"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Professional climber Sehyeon finds out about her pregnancy just before the World Championship. For her long-time aspiration as a climber, she struggles to break free from her baby, but the baby won’t let her go.", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 77, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Horror", "Psychological"], "tags": [{"name": "Pregnancy", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Athletics", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 143380, "title": {"romaji": "Hokkyokuguma Suggoku Hima", "english": "Polar Bear Bears Boredom"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A polar bear who is very bored with various marine animals in the deep blue sea.\nIt continues an ancient tradition of \"Caricatures of Frolicking animals\" in scroll painting-style; this time,\n\"Frolicking Sea Animals,\" in animation form, with a play on Japanese and English language word-plays: \"Hokyoku-Guma Suggoku Hima. / Polar bear bears boredom\", \"Kawauso Kawaisou./Other otter, poor otter,\" etc.<br>\n<br>\nThis project is inspired by the Japanese picture scroll in the 12 to 13 century: Bird and Beast Character Caricature. Marine animals spread out in world ocean. Using the short rhythm of the poem, you will enjoy the various sea animals' thoughts and life. This rhyme verse in both English and Japanese at same means and this film is continued in one scene and one cut for 7 minutes.<br>\n<br>\n<i>Debuted at the 39th Flickers' Rhode Island International Film Festival on August 14, 2021 during the 'KIDSEYE FILM FESTIVAL - ANIMATED SHORTS'.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 8}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2021, "episodes": 1, "duration": 7, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 143456, "title": {"romaji": "Shokuzai", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "It was created in 2019.<br>\nI hope you can interpret it in different ways!<br>\nI want to keep a dog, Dosamori!<br><br>\n(Source: YouTube Description, Translated)", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 6}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Horror", "Psychological"], "tags": [{"name": "Body Horror", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Body Image", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 143542, "title": {"romaji": "KRASUE", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "In a town of South-East Asia, at night, a Yakuza is facing a bloody conflict with local gangs. During the fight, he encounters with a ghost called Krasue (pronounced Gasoo), a flying woman head with her guts exposed, and is followed by her because of his blood's taste. Their battle eventually leads them to the depth of a dark and damp maze-like jungle, where boundaries between humans, animals and ghost seem to fade. With a howling noise, ”BOY MEETS GIRL” metamorphoses into ”Encounter with another species”.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: New Chitose Airport International Animation Festival)", "startDate": {"year": 2021, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2021, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 12, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Horror"], "tags": [{"name": "Yakuza", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ghost", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 143551, "title": {"romaji": "A Viva Non Non", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC"